<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts Super Sol.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts Super Sol.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Super Sol, an Israeli supermarket retailer, was cut to &quot;outperform&quot; from &quot;buy&quot; at Lehman Brothers, analyst Elise Horowitz at the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Horowitz said the stock had risen 23 percent since her last note on the stock.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
</text>
